-- Market Intelligence: the market summary (an analytical projection of raw sales)
-- STATUS: PROPOSED. Owner-approved design (2026-10-04): "raw sales = source of
-- truth; summary table = fast analytical projection; build it off-hours, refresh
-- incrementally/nightly, and make Market Intelligence read that instead."
-- NOT APPLIED. Apply plan, runtimes and evidence: docs/market-intelligence/SUMMARY_APPLY_PLAN.txt
-- Pretest (rollback-only):  PROPOSED_20261004150000_market_intel_geo_rollup_pretest.sql
